    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Objective</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>Little Kingdom RTS</i></strong>, you play as the ruler of a small kingdom. With limited resources, your task is to build a base, gather wood, stone, wheat, and gold, construct defenses, form an army, and survive enemy attacks. Your main goal is to conquer the entire map. Each level features a new map with unique resource placement, enemy kingdoms, secrets, and strategic opportunities. A survival mode is also available to test your tactics under constant enemy pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711950/extras/aba7f0c4841f42a323185ba55fa19d66.poster.avif?t=1750448768\" width=540 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711950/extras/aba7f0c4841f42a323185ba55fa19d66.webm?t=1750448768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711950/extras/aba7f0c4841f42a323185ba55fa19d66.mp4?t=1750448768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Gathering</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To develop your kingdom, you must efficiently manage three key resources:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0<strong>Wood</strong>: Gathered by lumberjacks you assign to nearby trees. Used for construction.<br>\u2022\u00a0<strong>Stone</strong>: Mined by workers at quarries built near rocky terrain.<br>\u2022 <strong>Gold:</strong> Obtained by workers in gold mines, which must be built near gold ore. <br>\u2022\u00a0<strong>Wheat</strong>: Grown on farms and required to sustain your economy and army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proper worker distribution and building near natural zones are vital for sustainable development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711950/extras/aea94eae7d45ba06ce03b859f657f123.poster.avif?t=1750448768\" width=540 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711950/extras/aea94eae7d45ba06ce03b859f657f123.webm?t=1750448768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711950/extras/aea94eae7d45ba06ce03b859f657f123.mp4?t=1750448768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Construction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can construct a wide variety of buildings, each serving an important function:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0<strong>Worker buildings</strong>: for lumberjacks, stonemasons, and wheat farmers.<br>\u2022\u00a0<strong>Military structures</strong>: barracks for knights, archers, cavalry, and mage towers.<br>\u2022\u00a0<strong>Defenses</strong>: archer towers, wooden palisades, and stone walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A well-planned base with complementary structures will help you survive even the harshest conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711950/extras/dfaf53f9a6465033c6df7bbdf8c94780.poster.avif?t=1750448768\" width=540 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711950/extras/dfaf53f9a6465033c6df7bbdf8c94780.webm?t=1750448768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711950/extras/dfaf53f9a6465033c6df7bbdf8c94780.mp4?t=1750448768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat plays a major role in gameplay. You must defend and attack in real time, commanding your army against:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0Armies of rival kingdoms.<br>\u2022\u00a0Orcs, including warriors, archers, mages, and wolf riders.<br>\u2022\u00a0Wild animals and fantasy monsters.<br>\u2022\u00a0Undead, demons and other dark forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy requires a unique strategy, and every map offers distinct battle challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711950/extras/144d99176306a63ef4708c16cd5bc5ba.poster.avif?t=1750448768\" width=540 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711950/extras/144d99176306a63ef4708c16cd5bc5ba.webm?t=1750448768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711950/extras/144d99176306a63ef4708c16cd5bc5ba.mp4?t=1750448768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0Classic real-time strategy gameplay<br>\u2022\u00a0Charming pixel art inspired by retro games<br>\u2022\u00a0Varied maps with increasing difficulty<br>\u2022\u00a0Unique economy and building system<br>\u2022\u00a0Two modes: campaign and survival</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From the Developers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Little Kingdom RTS</i></strong> is an indie game developed by a solo developer. The game is promoted by a single indie publisher. Your feedback and support mean the world to us \u2013 add the game to your wishlist and help us grow. The release is coming soon!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Objective</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>Little Kingdom RTS</i></strong>, you play as the ruler of a small kingdom. With limited resources, your task is to build a base, gather wood, stone, wheat, and gold, construct defenses, form an army, and survive enemy attacks. Your main goal is to conquer the entire map. Each level features a new map with unique resource placement, enemy kingdoms, secrets, and strategic opportunities. A survival mode is also available to test your tactics under constant enemy pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711950/extras/aba7f0c4841f42a323185ba55fa19d66.poster.avif?t=1750448768\" width=540 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711950/extras/aba7f0c4841f42a323185ba55fa19d66.webm?t=1750448768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711950/extras/aba7f0c4841f42a323185ba55fa19d66.mp4?t=1750448768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Gathering</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To develop your kingdom, you must efficiently manage three key resources:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0<strong>Wood</strong>: Gathered by lumberjacks you assign to nearby trees. Used for construction.<br>\u2022\u00a0<strong>Stone</strong>: Mined by workers at quarries built near rocky terrain.<br>\u2022 <strong>Gold:</strong> Obtained by workers in gold mines, which must be built near gold ore. <br>\u2022\u00a0<strong>Wheat</strong>: Grown on farms and required to sustain your economy and army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proper worker distribution and building near natural zones are vital for sustainable development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711950/extras/aea94eae7d45ba06ce03b859f657f123.poster.avif?t=1750448768\" width=540 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711950/extras/aea94eae7d45ba06ce03b859f657f123.webm?t=1750448768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711950/extras/aea94eae7d45ba06ce03b859f657f123.mp4?t=1750448768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Construction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can construct a wide variety of buildings, each serving an important function:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0<strong>Worker buildings</strong>: for lumberjacks, stonemasons, and wheat farmers.<br>\u2022\u00a0<strong>Military structures</strong>: barracks for knights, archers, cavalry, and mage towers.<br>\u2022\u00a0<strong>Defenses</strong>: archer towers, wooden palisades, and stone walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A well-planned base with complementary structures will help you survive even the harshest conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711950/extras/dfaf53f9a6465033c6df7bbdf8c94780.poster.avif?t=1750448768\" width=540 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711950/extras/dfaf53f9a6465033c6df7bbdf8c94780.webm?t=1750448768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711950/extras/dfaf53f9a6465033c6df7bbdf8c94780.mp4?t=1750448768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat plays a major role in gameplay. You must defend and attack in real time, commanding your army against:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0Armies of rival kingdoms.<br>\u2022\u00a0Orcs, including warriors, archers, mages, and wolf riders.<br>\u2022\u00a0Wild animals and fantasy monsters.<br>\u2022\u00a0Undead, demons and other dark forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy requires a unique strategy, and every map offers distinct battle challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711950/extras/144d99176306a63ef4708c16cd5bc5ba.poster.avif?t=1750448768\" width=540 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711950/extras/144d99176306a63ef4708c16cd5bc5ba.webm?t=1750448768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711950/extras/144d99176306a63ef4708c16cd5bc5ba.mp4?t=1750448768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0Classic real-time strategy gameplay<br>\u2022\u00a0Charming pixel art inspired by retro games<br>\u2022\u00a0Varied maps with increasing difficulty<br>\u2022\u00a0Unique economy and building system<br>\u2022\u00a0Two modes: campaign and survival</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From the Developers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Little Kingdom RTS</i></strong> is an indie game developed by a solo developer. The game is promoted by a single indie publisher. Your feedback and support mean the world to us \u2013 add the game to your wishlist and help us grow. The release is coming soon!</p>",
    "short_description": "Little Kingdom RTS is an indie real-time strategy game set in a medieval fantasy world. Gather resources, build settlements, raise walls, and grow your small kingdom. Command an army of knights, archers, and mages to fight off rival kingdoms, orcs, and undead.",
